#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/autotuner/grouped_compile/index.rst:40
msgid ""
"Flow: 1. Elaborate each config into a PrimFunc. 2. Lower each PrimFunc into "
"host/device IR modules. 3. Merge all device IR into one IRModule and compile "
"device code once. 4. Build host runtime module per config and import shared "
"device module. 5. Construct per-config JITKernel objects that share the "
"grouped device module."
msgstr ""

